Changes 2022–2026:
*February 2024: Labina Basit (Labour) leaves party to sit as an independent<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothroyd |first1=David |title=Will you ever win? |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2024/02/will-you-ever-win/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk}}</ref>
*March 2024: Alan Chapman (Conservative) resigns – by-election held May 2024<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothroyd |first1=David |title=Somerset turns another Page |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2024/03/somerset-turns-another-page/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk |access-date=19 January 2026}}</ref>
*May 2024: Kelly Martin (Conservative) wins by-election<ref>{{cite web |title=Local Elections Archive Project — Hillingdon East Ward |url=https://www.andrewteale.me.uk/leap/ward/21474/#2024-05-02 |website=www.andrewteale.me.uk |access-date=19 January 2026}}</ref>
*June 2025: Peter Curling (Labour) and Janet Gardner (Labour) leave party to sit as independents<ref name="Lab">{{cite news |last1=Lynch |first1=Philip James |title=West London Labour group unable to find enough female candidates for 2026 |url=https://www.mylondon.news/news/west-london-news/west-london-labour-group-unable-32737672 |access-date=19 January 2026 |work=My London |date=24 October 2025 |language=en}}</ref>
*September 2025: Scott Farley (Labour) and Rita Judge (Labour) leave party to sit as independents<ref name="Lab" />
*October 2025:
**Jas Dhot (Labour) joins Conservatives<ref name=":0">{{cite news |title=Hillingdon Labour councillor defects to Conservative group |url=https://www.hillingdontimes.co.uk/news/25559800.hillingdon-labour-councillor-defects-conservative-group/ |access-date=19 January 2026 |work=Hillingdon Times |date=21 October 2025 |language=en}}</ref>
**Naser Abby (Labour) suspended from party<ref>{{cite news |last1=Lynch |first1=Philip James |title=West London Labour councillor suspended over claims of 'working with Reform UK' |url=https://www.mylondon.news/news/west-london-news/west-london-labour-councillor-suspended-32782745 |access-date=19 January 2026 |work=My London |date=30 October 2025 |language=en}}</ref>
*January 2026: Hayes Independent Party formed – Labina Basit, Peter Curling, Scott Farley, Janet Gardner, and Rita Judge (Independent) join party<ref>{{cite web |title=Hayes Independent Party |url=https://search.electoralcommission.org.uk/English/Registrations/PP18196 |website=Electoral Commission |access-date=19 January 2026}}</ref>
*February 2026:
**Keith Burrows (Conservative) resigns – seat left vacant until election<ref>{{cite web |last1=Boothroyd |first1=David |title=Shirley is serious |url=https://www.localcouncils.co.uk/2026/02/shirley-is-serious/ |website=LocalCouncils.co.uk |access-date=5 May 2026}}</ref>
**Naser Abby (Independent) joins Greens<ref>{{cite news |last1=Lynch |first1=Philip James |title=Councillor expelled by Labour over 'fake Facebook profile' joins Greens |url=https://www.mylondon.news/news/west-london-news/hillingdon-councillor-expelled-labour-over-33566652 |access-date=5 May 2026 |work=My London |date=10 March 2026 |language=en}}</ref>
*Countermanded Poll
**Hillingdon West Ward election will take place on 18th June 2026<ref>https://pre.hillingdon.gov.uk/downloads/file/2825/notice-of-countermanded-poll-2026</ref>

